    "description": {
      "content": "Zipkin's HTTP API for querying and ingesting distributed tracing data. The API exposes span ingestion and trace, dependency, and autocomplete lookup operations under the `/api/v2` base. Authentication is typically handled by a reverse proxy in front of Zipkin and is not part of the core API.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OpenZipkin",
